y guiding the one thing in all the heavens that <i>doesn't move</i>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/558-gaius","name":"Gaius","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2028"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T22:18:21-08:00","id":63773,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gaius</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/63616-forms-of-magic-other-then-sorcery-and-necromancy?p=63770#post63770\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">He <i>has</i> learned much from Holden in the Art of the Troll.<br /> <br /> *suspects he will soon learn if this is an extant Art of the Dress parody, should a knowledgeable brony pass by*</div> </div> </div> </div>No, this is from Mawaru Penguindrum.<br /> <br /> After consulting a friend who has watched it regarding the scene, my best guess is as follows:<br /> <br /> &quot;Uh... maybe... Liminals...? ...Maybe?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Once, there was a maiden... who spent all her time on the internet.<br /> &quot;Someone out there is WRONG,&quot; she said.<br /> So she tossed a noose made of golden light... and strangled her opponent.<br /> Both of them died alone.<br /> &quot;Love is for football players and cheerleaders,&quot; her obituary said.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/261-notthepenguins","name":"notthepenguins",